"""ROS-native AGV data recorder installed as ``ros2 run navigation data``.

This logger intentionally shares summary.csv columns with
F4gateway/tools/data.py.  Here the transport is ROS topics, so it validates the
sensor data after F411/Yahboom drivers, calibration, timestamp mapping and
localization rather than taking ownership of the serial ports.
